WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.761
- [Mark] All right, Mike and Tina?

00:00:08.761 --> 00:00:09.737
- Yes.

00:00:09.737 --> 00:00:12.330
- [Mark] Mike and Tina, where
are you guys from originally?

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:13.990
