been hard for a young man

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:36.604
to deal with.

00:02:36.604 --> 00:02:38.593
- Yes, it was hard,

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.510
cause I didn't really, like

00:02:43.311 --> 00:02:45.727
I didn't think about it a lot
until like, it was just me

00:02:45.727 --> 00:02:48.737
