just thinking about like,

00:02:48.737 --> 00:02:52.313
I don't know, I just picture
us looking at the windows.

00:02:55.474 --> 00:03:00.080
Then my mom, like we moved
around a lot in Virginia Beach.

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:03.520
That's where they separated,
my stepdad, and my mom.

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:05.550
