to cover up the pain

00:25:13.080 --> 00:25:16.070
to feel that I have a small shell.

00:25:16.070 --> 00:25:18.390
I probably would've changed shells by now

00:25:18.390 --> 00:25:19.973
and grown as a person.

00:25:21.567 --> 00:25:24.030
I got out of this rut
instead of furnishing it.

00:25:24.030 --> 00:25:24.863
So I think,

00:25:26.225 --> 00:25:28.200
I kinda sidetracked
that answer a little bit

00:25:28.200 --> 00:25:29.863
but yeah,

00:25:30.839 --> 00:25:33.740
